              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Warriors have hand weapons and shield. Warriors may have light armour (+2 points) throwing or thrusting spears (+2 points) and javelins (+1 point). Warband (rule 2 does not apply).</characteristic>
