    <rule id="f05b-66ee-6f1e-cb46" name="Early Eastern Tribes (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #112 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). This list represents the “barbarian” peoples surrounding the Chinese state from its formation until their widespread adoption of the horse fundamentally changed the nature of the threat they posed to it. 

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Early Eastern Tribes]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Infantry: at least 50%
  Characters: up to 33% Infantry: At least 50%</description>
